  "notes": "The second report came with screenshots of single shots at a level 200 Runner, asked for with no mods, standing still, at the body: 82 and a yellow 164 at 6 m; 60 and 61, a yellow 123 and a 182 to the head at 13 m; 46 and 47, and a 145 to the head, at 15 m; 24 and 25, and yellow 49 and 51, at 17 m; 16 at 19 and 22 m. No numbers were predicted to Pavel. As in T-25, a waypoint of 13 m means more than 12 and up to 13 m: the cases use the middle of that metre, and the tolerance is half a metre of the line and half a point. The wiki's line, down to 20% at 20 m, would show 53 at 15 m, 39 at 17 m and 26 at 19 m. A line that ends halfway would show 49 at 13 m and 23 at 15 m. The Strun report doesn't say which enemy and body part, so no case replays it; the engine gives 30, 18 and 18 on the body of a Runner.",
